# Shared Prettier ignore for the whole monorepo (frontend, backend, sdk).
# Each package's `format` / `format:check` script runs Prettier from its own
# directory; Prettier resolves this file by walking up from the target files,
# so it applies everywhere without duplication.

# Dependency & build output
**/node_modules/**
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/out/**
**/coverage/**
**/storybook-static/**
**/target/**

# Test artifacts
**/playwright-report/**
**/test-results/**
**/blob-report/**

# Lockfiles (formatting these is noisy and not useful)
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock

# Generated / vendored
**/*.wasm
**/next-env.d.ts
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/*.min.js

# Misc
**/.DS_Store
**/*.pem
